# The `t` theme picker (spec 6): `t` opens the toolbar's theme dropdown, j / k (Down / Up) move the
# highlight and the page previews it live (nothing is saved), Enter keeps it, Esc puts the old theme
# back. No key reaches the document: every shot shows the top of the page.
size 900 600
open pages.md
settle
keys t
settle
keys j down
settle
shot preview.png
keys esc
settle
shot reverted.png
keys t
settle
keys j
settle
keys enter
settle
shot kept.png
